{
    "word": "magnate",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "673a3d02-81bd-3f70-8957-d87c21933061",
                "word": "magnate",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "56bd24c5-c0b8-4031-8620-ce2283ac3e4e",
                        "entry_id": "673a3d02-81bd-3f70-8957-d87c21933061",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "magnates"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "359a496d-af5a-35c3-bcc1-507cab663c4d",
                        "entry_id": "673a3d02-81bd-3f70-8957-d87c21933061",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Powerful industrialist; captain of industry."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3b61bdf-2c06-4bea-99f7-77ac7e569e4d",
                                "sense_id": "359a496d-af5a-35c3-bcc1-507cab663c4d",
                                "text": "I have decided to become an oil magnate, after spending quite some time reading the dictionary definition of the word magnate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "05baf57d-bfdf-42f5-b900-872d246fd462",
                                "sense_id": "359a496d-af5a-35c3-bcc1-507cab663c4d",
                                "text": "With a suitable amount of life experience under her belt, she sat down and conjured up the sexiest, most delicious Italian wine magnate she could imagine, had him make his biggest mistake, and gave him a wife on the run."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a734716e-d360-4548-a003-edf1478cf126",
                                "sense_id": "359a496d-af5a-35c3-bcc1-507cab663c4d",
                                "text": "Sir Richard Branson is an English business magnate, best known as the founder of the multimillion-pound Virgin Group, which consists of more than four hundred companies."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2d635752-4606-3e55-a83f-857c72fed4e3",
                        "entry_id": "673a3d02-81bd-3f70-8957-d87c21933061",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person of rank, influence or distinction in any sphere."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb5a45aa-49e4-4aaf-99be-14630970c878",
                                "sense_id": "2d635752-4606-3e55-a83f-857c72fed4e3",
                                "text": "[…] but there is not an illiterate Justice of the Peace, or rural magnate in the form of a country squire, that would not detect such a man as an empirie at once, if he rested his claim to such an appointment on the score of his scholarship."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "12411fe7-73f7-33a4-b94f-9ee05d1a9b66",
                        "entry_id": "673a3d02-81bd-3f70-8957-d87c21933061",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In medieval and early modern Italy, a member of a legally defined category of especially wealthy patrician families, often deprived of the right to political participation by republican governments."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "de28d748-b2dc-42a1-81e0-f9bf6826047c",
                                "sense_id": "12411fe7-73f7-33a4-b94f-9ee05d1a9b66",
                                "text": "Those considered politically dangerous could be excluded from office by declaring them magnates, while cancellation of magnate status was a mark of favour, a means of political patronage."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d4f60a5d-e05f-4d49-b94d-2ad2638cb297",
                        "source_entry_id": "673a3d02-81bd-3f70-8957-d87c21933061",
                        "source_sense_description": "Powerful industrialist; captain of industry.",
                        "target_lang_word": "magnaat",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "magnaat",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7de902fc-a4ed-3244-b97d-afb9249f8375",
                                        "entry_id": "630a9fd1-a0ce-342e-99c7-c2232bebc78c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zeer rijk en daardoor invloedrijk persoon"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7ec072b2-95a4-4582-8a51-d7740fdbfc18",
                        "source_entry_id": "673a3d02-81bd-3f70-8957-d87c21933061",
                        "source_sense_description": "Powerful industrialist; captain of industry.",
                        "target_lang_word": "magnat",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "magnat",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3b726b9-27f7-35f1-9cbe-cb327e5fcbc4",
                                        "entry_id": "5253d9c2-5127-3686-9e2d-0810da818d19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Grand du royaume, dans l’ancienne Pologne et l’ancienne Hongrie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38f18691-7868-4506-9f29-0a318df5f620",
                                                "sense_id": "a3b726b9-27f7-35f1-9cbe-cb327e5fcbc4",
                                                "text": "Mais quand tout fut fini, les magnats accoururent des quatre coins de la Pologne, en qualité de sauveurs de la patrie. Les sauveurs sont la plaie des révolutions populaires."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ccddd57-5c27-4a8a-a712-17976353b7ee",
                                                "sense_id": "a3b726b9-27f7-35f1-9cbe-cb327e5fcbc4",
                                                "text": "Son crâne rasé de près et ses longues moustaches tombantes donnaient à ce Français du Nord un faux air de magnat hongrois."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "652da49a-9bec-32de-9402-013d24beeef0",
                                        "entry_id": "5253d9c2-5127-3686-9e2d-0810da818d19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne dominante ou importante ; VIP."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d69a181e-5d15-4049-b908-b53f1456508f",
                                                "sense_id": "652da49a-9bec-32de-9402-013d24beeef0",
                                                "text": "J’entends bien, encore une fois, qu’on me dénonce les grands magnats du vin, les féodaux du vignoble, ceux qui, séjournant à Paris ou dans les villes d’eaux se contentent de percevoir ici des revenus annuels se chiffrant par millions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a65e8ddb-74aa-49db-a173-7efbb1582f0c",
                                                "sense_id": "652da49a-9bec-32de-9402-013d24beeef0",
                                                "text": "Face aux potentialités technologiques et aux moyens colossaux qui sont les leurs, un sentiment de toute-puissance prend ces magnats de la Silicon Valley."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07fe65bb-d674-448c-9ceb-797f2af03d3e",
                                                "sense_id": "652da49a-9bec-32de-9402-013d24beeef0",
                                                "text": "Elle s’est remariée en 2017 avec Michael Herd, un magnat du pétrole, avec qui elle a deux enfants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
